    "chunk_size_bytes": 2071,
    "chunk_text": "Last time during the COVID-19 epidemic, there was forced cremation of victims as suggested by an expert committee, implementing an unscientific, racist policy. And later, your Government apologized for it and we appreciate that. But still, no departmental inquiry has been conducted against that expert committee for having taken that unscientific decision or for having arrived at such a horrendous decision without any foundation, which caused serious trauma for the entire Muslim community in this country.\n\nThen, there are also others. Today, it has been reported in the newspapers that another member of that expert committee called Dr. Ruwanpura, JMO of the Karapitiya Teaching Hospital, has spoken about legalizing abortion. These people are taking all kinds of new stands now, whereas they had, without any basis, taken that unscientific decision which caused serious impact on the Muslim community in this country. Therefore, I am requesting you, Hon. Minister, since your Government has apologized for that decision, please take action not to appoint such officials to such important positions, particularly if there is a pandemic once again. Our community is seriously worried about this issue.\n\n\u0dd4 \u0dc3\u0dc0\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dba \u0dbb\u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dad \u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5\u0dbb\u0dab \u0db8 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0bae\u0bb5\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baf \u0b95\u0bb2\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0bb0\u0bae\u0bc8\u0bb7\u0bcd \u0baa\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba3) (The Hon. (Dr.) Ramesh Pathirana) Hon. Speaker, pandemic preparedness from the side of the Ministry of Health, I think, is much better now than yesteryear. We have taken all the necessary measures to ensure that people would not suffer, as indicated by the Hon. Rauff Hakeem. Also, I must mention categorically the fact that most of the appointments and also the\n\n463 464\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0dc0\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dba \u0dc1\u0dda\u0dc2\u0dca\u0da8\u0dda \u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dad \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n2024 \u0d85\u0dc1\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dda\u0dd4 21"
  },
