    "md5": "7ac212d211bfcff5faab44c476fb1b80",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1159,
    "chunk_text": "While we are on that, I must say that there are several pieces of legislation that have been introduced in this House in the last 20 months or so mostly by your predecessor and former senior, who is a Presidential candidate now, the Hon. (Dr.) Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, President\u2019s Counsel. He claims that there had been about 75 or so new laws introduced. We have not kept count of that. Nevertheless, law reform is an important issue and modernizing our laws is an essential feature and I am glad that some of the laws that were brought in were necessary and served to fulfil a long-felt need.\n\n697 698\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n2024 \u0dc3\u0d9a\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dda\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 03\n\nFirst time and then, there were two petitioners who went to the Supreme Court on that. They cited me as a respondent and I appeared in person. Then, the Supreme Court gave its Determination stating that subject to the change of wording the Supreme Court itself suggested, it could be passed with a simple majority."
  },
  {
